{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@3565","endTime":348490.112,"result":{"value":"All projects\nMOBILE EXPERIENCE / 01\nLivSocial.\n\nLivSocial’s mobile interface brings a social feed, profile discovery, and community content into a compact touch layout.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nMobile apps\nFOCUS\nSocial & community\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nConversations, made mobile.\n\nThe mobile LivSocial artwork shows sign-in, people, and content-feed screens within the same product family as its web presentation. Image posts and conversation controls occupy the main screen, while profile imagery and navigation help organize the community around the feed.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in LivSocial's original project material.\n\n01\nPost cards\n\nImages and written updates share a vertically arranged feed.\n\n02\nProfile discovery\n\nPeople and profile imagery form part of the community interface.\n\n03\nAccount entry\n\nA dedicated welcome and sign-in view introduces the product.\n\n04\nMobile navigation\n\nCompact navigation keeps the main areas within reach.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nSocial & community\n\nWarm gold accents carry the identity into a smaller screen. Rounded profile images, white post cards, and a compact bottom navigation provide a consistent frame for media-heavy content. The gallery includes the mobile-specific artwork retained from the source.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside LivSocial.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n01\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT MOBILE PROJECT\nSimply Recruited\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nRECRUITMENT & PROFILES\nSimply Recruited\nNOTES & DOCUMENTS\nInfinote\nLOGISTICS & SHIPMENT RECORDS\nSilasync\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
